const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文描绘不同法律环境下大公司最终所有权和控制权的结构。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Corporate Ownership Around the World” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"研究根据控制链、投票权和最终所有者识别规则比较跨国公司样本。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Corporate Ownership Around the World”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要公司实体、股权与投票权、控制链、披露版本、国家制度口径和观察日期。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Corporate Ownership Around the World”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"其价值在于说明所有权与控制权不能仅凭直接持股读出；它不对任何公司当前控制人或治理质量作断言。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Corporate Ownership Around the World”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结公司范围和控制阈值，保存股权结构披露版本，处理交叉持股与多层实体，并按披露可得时间连接。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Corporate Ownership Around the World”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (1999)。所有权网络会变化，跨国披露口径也不同；历史映射不能被当作实时受益所有人或治理评分。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (1999) for “Corporate Ownership Around the World”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Corporate Ownership Around the World”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。所有权网络会变化，跨国披露口径也不同；历史映射不能被当作实时受益所有人或治理评分。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Corporate Ownership Around the World”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
